{"ticker":{"symbol":"OPENL","name":"Opendoor Technologies Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":0.0321,"change_pct":-0.49448818897637803,"market_cap":null,"pe":null,"pb":0.050392464,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.027,"week52_high":1.14,"sector":"","industry":"","country":"United States","city":"Tempe","employees":1042,"website":"https://www.opendoor.com","business_summary":"Opendoor Technologies Inc. operates a digital platform for residential real estate transactions in the United States. It buys and sells homes through online e-commerce platform. The company also resells the home to a home buyer. In addition, it offers real estate brokerage, title insurance and settlement, and escrow services, as well as property and casualty insurance, real estate licenses, and construction services. The company was formerly known as Social Capital Hedosophia Holdings Corp. II and changed its name to Opendoor Technologies Inc. Opendoor Technologies Inc. was incorporated in 2013 and is based in Tempe, Arizona.","business_summary_ko":"Opendoor Technologies Inc.는 미국에서 주거용 부동산 거래를 위한 디지털 플랫폼을 운영합니다. 온라인 전자상거래 플랫폼을 통해 주택을 사고 파는 것입니다. 회사는 또한 주택을 주택 구매자에게 재판매합니다. 또한 부동산 중개, 소유권 보험 및 결제, 에스크로 서비스는 물론 재산 및 상해 보험, 부동산 라이센스, 건설 서비스도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Social Capital Hedosophia Holdings Corp. II로 알려졌으며 이름을 Opendoor Technologies Inc.로 변경했습니다. Opendoor Technologies Inc.는 2013년에 설립되었으며 애리조나주 템피에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":3697135500.0,"rev_lo":3665500000.0,"rev_hi":3728771000.0,"rev_g":-0.1542,"n":2},{"period":"2027","rev":7056980350.0,"rev_lo":5325000000.0,"rev_hi":9833255730.0,"rev_g":0.90879995,"n":9}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":15567000000.0,"operating_income":-854000000.0,"net_income":-1353000000.0,"eps":null},{"period":"2023","revenue":6946000000.0,"operating_income":-372000000.0,"net_income":-275000000.0,"eps":null},{"period":"2024","revenue":5153000000.0,"operating_incom